## Original Content
The 32nd Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation (APEC) Small and Medium Enterprises (SME) Ministerial Meeting will be held on Sept. 4 in Guangzhou, south China's Guangdong Province, the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology (MIIT) said on Monday.

## Summary
The 32nd Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation (APEC) Small and Medium Enterprises (SME) Ministerial Meeting is set for September 4 in Guangzhou, China, with a focus on innovation and cooperation. The event, announced by the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology (MIIT), aims to foster development among SMEs in the region.

## Key Points
- The 32nd APEC SME Ministerial Meeting will occur on Sept. 4 in Guangzhou, China.
- The meeting emphasizes innovation and cooperation as its core themes.
- The announcement comes from the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology (MIIT).


